      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To navigate this challenge, it's crucial for CardioZen reps to emphasis on the positive aspects, while also being transparent about the registered side effects. They could stress the exceptional cardiovascular benefits of CardioZen and outline that while dizziness is reported more frequently, it also leads to faster recovery of patients' stability over time, compared to the competitor. Assurance that ongoing research and development are working towards optimizing the formulation to minimize this side effect can reinforce dedication to patient health and well-being. Further, comparing overall health improvements and rehabilitation efficiency may reinforce CardioZen's value proposition despite the initial dizziness reports.",
